<section class="chapter" id="map" data-phase="3" aria-labelledby="map-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="chapter-copy">
      <h2 class="display-l" id="map-title">A live map, derived from code.</h2>
      <p class="body-l">
        Components, contracts, owners and risk labels, rebuilt on every change. Agents ask the map instead of
        reading 50 files and guessing. This change adds one edge that matters: customer phone numbers now reach an
        outside SMS provider.
      </p>
      <p class="query">
        <span class="q">What depends on UserPreferences?</span>
        <span class="a">notifications, billing</span>
      </p>
      <dl class="figures">
        <div><dt class="caption muted">Twenty, an open-source CRM</dt><dd><b>31,000</b> files · <b>72,000</b> symbols</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="caption muted">Mapped from scratch</dt><dd><b>3.5 s</b></dd></div>
        <div><dt class="caption muted">A question to the warm map</dt><dd><b>under 1 ms</b></dd></div>
        <div><dt class="caption muted">Dependents the compiler finds</dt><dd><b>99.9%</b> found</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

